<section class="technology" id="technology"><div class="section-label"><span>THE ARCHITECTURE</span><span class="muted">FIVE LAYERS. SHARED PURPOSE.</span></div><div class="tech-grid"><div class="tech-heading reveal"><h2>Five layers.<br><span>One direction.</span></h2><p>AUREON brings the building blocks of blockchain into a clear, connected architecture.</p><div class="small-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 50 50"><path d="m25 4 20 11-20 11L5 15ZM5 24l20 11 20-11M5 33l20 11 20-11"/></svg></div></div><div class="tech-accordion reveal"><div class="tech-row"><h3><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="layer-protocol"><span>01</span><strong>Protocol layer</strong><i>+</i></button></h3><p id="layer-protocol" hidden>Shared rules give independent participants a common starting point. Open protocols make connection possible.</p></div><div class="tech-row"><h3><button aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="layer-application"><span>02</span><strong>Application layer</strong><i>+</i></button></h3><p id="layer-application">The place where systems become useful. Create digital assets, connect workflows, and shape experiences around the people who use them.</p></div><div class="tech-row"><h3><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="layer-network"><span>03</span><strong>Network layer</strong><i>+</i></button></h3><p id="layer-network" hidden>Link participants and information across a distributed network, giving every connection a role in the wider system.</p></div><div class="tech-row"><h3><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="layer-infrastructure"><span>04</span><strong>Infrastructure layer</strong><i>+</i></button></h3><p id="layer-infrastructure" hidden>Organize the nodes, data, and services beneath your applications. Start with a foundation that leaves room for your next idea.</p></div><div class="tech-row"><h3><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="layer-services"><span>05</span><strong>Services & components</strong><i>+</i></button></h3><p id="layer-services" hidden>Bring the right pieces together. Modular tools and services connect blockchain capabilities to the way your team works.</p></div></div></div></section>
